WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.390
Big news: I just got promoted
to Senior AI Engineer!

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.760
Let me take you back. A little
over a year ago, I joined Swirl.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:11.420
Since then,

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:15.570
I have built 20 AI agents
and worked with 4 clients,

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:19.570
across the UAE,
Saudi Arabia and the US.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.540
Cars, real estate,
HVAC, even laptops.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.050
They talk to real car buyers.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:27.750
They find the right car,

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.030
work out the payment,

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.800
handle the trade-in,
and book the test drive.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.370
Over 1,600 commits.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:39.950
244 PRs merged,
118 of them to production.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.800
And over 1,100 tasks closed.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.470
And at one US dealership,

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:50.770
lead to sale hit 1.8x the
baseline in the first 19 days.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.470
The day it went live,
our CEO wrote this.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.990
Thank you so much to Swirl
management and the whole team.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:09.210
Keeping it going!
